        "client_18": {"type": "gaussian_noise", "params": {"sigma": 2.0}},
        "client_19": {"type": "gaussian_noise", "params": {"sigma": 2.0}}
      },
      "comment": "NO WARMUP (matching Szelag's actual code): all 9 malicious clients (11-19) inject Gaussian noise (mean=2, std=2 -> sigma=2.0) from round 1. This matches reproduce_szelag_v2.py behavior."
    },
    {
      "rounds": [16, 16],
      "participants": [
        "client_0", "client_1", "client_2", "client_3", "client_4",
